WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.033
Gradient descent finds a curve's lowest point.

2
00:00:03.367 --> 00:00:05.967
Stand on this hill at x equals three.

3
00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:09.067
Walk downhill, step by step.

4
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.267
The rule: step against the slope.

5
00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:19.900
For x squared, slope is two x: six at three, pointing uphill.

6
00:00:20.233 --> 00:00:23.867
So step downhill, scaled by a learning rate of a quarter.

7
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:32.167
Step one: three minus a quarter of six: one point five.

8
00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:35.833
Step two: zero point seven five.

9
00:00:36.167 --> 00:00:39.500
Step three: zero point three seven five.

10
00:00:39.833 --> 00:00:43.000
X halves each time; height nears zero.

11
00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:50.367
Rate zero point one: x crawls from three to two point four.

12
00:00:50.700 --> 00:00:53.000
Rate one jumps to minus three

13
00:00:53.167 --> 00:00:54.867
and bounces forever.
